  day: 4
  text: "*The creature approaches as it does everyday, but this time it stops by
    a small bulletin board that hangs at the mine entrance. It seems to be\u2026
    staring? There\u2019s a picture hanging there of all the workers and the previous
    foreman F11. The creature seems to be leaking from its face, as a pool of water
    forms beneath it. Should probably get Elsa to take a look at it. Wouldn\u2019t
    be good if we had a malfunction in the middle of shift*"
